            "rationale": "The new domain rules sit in Tier 2 Catalog: on-shelf status (isOnShelf), search matching (searchBooks) and branch ordering (allBranches). search and branches in Tier 3 call them through onShelfCount. bookCopies is the exception. It works out on-loan versus on-shelf again in Tier 3 by looking up library.Loans directly instead of asking Catalog.isOnShelf, and the CLI turns DueBack = None into 'on shelf'. That copied predicate agrees with the Tier 2 rule and does not contradict it.",
