            "rationale": "Most of the rules are in Tier 2: ISBN exact match goes into Catalog.searchBooks, branch copies into Catalog.copiesOfAt, and the unknown-branch check reuses Catalog.findBranch. One part of the search rule is decided only in the Tier 3 projection: a branch search lists only books with at least one copy at that branch. It is a local special case next to the Tier 2 search, not a contradiction of it. The CLI only adds the ' at <branch>' text.",
